{
  "post": {
    "id": "1586071",
    "published": "2015-11-21T05:10:18.000Z",
    "title": "またね大阪！行くぜ名古屋！",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/1586071.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170907060145/https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/1586071.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんにちは、鹿乃です"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大家好，我是鹿乃。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hello, I'm Kano"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "235cc7ea408b.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/3/ic_biccuri02.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "アニメイト大阪日本橋店さんでのリリース記念イベントが先ほど無事に終了しました。会いにきてくださった皆さん、ありがとうございましたっ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "刚才在 Animate 大阪日本桥店举行的发售纪念活动顺利结束了。特意来见我的各位，谢谢你们！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The release commemoration event at Animate Osaka Nipponbashi just finished safely. Thank you to everyone who came to see me!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "3e21de3d7c24.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/5/4/5466ccec.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "お写真はアニメイト大阪日本橋店さんが用意してくださったオリジナルポスターです！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这张照片是 Animate 大阪日本桥店为我们准备的原创海报！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The photo is the original poster that Animate Osaka Nipponbashi prepared for us!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "実は駆けつけてくださっていた、ジャケ絵イラストをいつも描いてくださっている水玉さんとパシャパシャお写真を撮りながら欲しいね〜って言ってました笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "其实，一直帮我画封面插画的水玉さん也赶到了现场，我们俩一边咔嚓咔嚓地拍着照片，一边说着“好想要呀～”（笑）。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Mizutama, who always draws the jacket illustrations, actually came too, and while we were snapping photos we were saying \"we want one of these~\" lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "あとですね〜〜〜〜〜"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "还有啊～～～～～"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "And also~~~~~"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "0ccd0a7d4f86.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/4/b/4b176a64.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "じゃーーーーん"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "锵————！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Ta-daaaaa"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "22d4d7823f10.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/3/ic_pikapika.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "幸せを呼ぶゴッドハンドと常々噂を聞いていたアニメイト大阪日本橋店の店長さんの手の写真を撮らせていただきました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我有幸拍到了 Animate 大阪日本桥店店长的手，早就听说那是一双能带来幸福的“神之手”。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I got to take a photo of the hand of the manager of Animate Osaka Nipponbashi, who I'd always heard rumors about as having the \"God Hand that brings happiness\"."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "カメラに入りきらないくらい大きい！御利益めちゃくちゃありそう！！！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大得镜头都快装不下了！感觉福气肯定超级灵！！！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It's so big it doesn't fit in the camera! It must bring tons of good luck!!!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2ndシングルがもっとたくさん聴いてもらえますように〜〜なんでもいいから幸せになりますように〜〜って水玉さんと二人で拝み倒しちゃいました笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我和水玉さん两个人对着它拜了又拜，祈祷着“希望第二张单曲能被更多人听到～～希望不管怎样大家都能幸福～～”（笑）。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Mizutama and I both prayed to it like crazy: \"Please let even more people hear my 2nd single~~ Please let us be happy, no matter how~~\" lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "御利益はよこい〜〜っ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "福气快来呀～～！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Bring me good luck~~!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "ee6dd6586d4a.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/6/d/6d7ebf7d.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "7f6f5fdec02c.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/7/2/72ad5aa6.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "というわけで大阪名物のたこ焼きと豚まん食べて、ユンケルも飲んだので次の名古屋も頑張ってきますー！来る方はよろしくお願いしますっ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "总之，吃了大阪名产章鱼烧和猪肉包子，还喝了ユンケル，所以下一站名古屋我也会加油的！要来的各位请多多关照！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "So, having eaten Osaka's famous takoyaki and pork buns and drunk a Yunker, I'll do my best at the next stop, Nagoya! If you're coming, please look forward to it!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "……このユンケル、めっちゃ効く笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "……这个ユンケル，效果超猛（笑）。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "...This Yunker works so well lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "再见啦，大阪！出发，名古屋！",
    "titleEn": "See You Again, Osaka! Here I Come, Nagoya!"
  },
